{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_080_title", "source_sha256": "0e6689f9e19a71b282c49d6b83398ccaf2f4f89e45875984d14a86592c8fb192", "ja": "約束の、その先へ", "zh": "迈向约定的彼方", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_080_synopsis", "source_sha256": "271121b8d2ced3a4a038318288a6ad1beccc8aec23be848b0aa99f197cf75313", "ja": "次の公演に向けてレッスンが進む中、紗代子\nはあるファンレターをきっかけに、アイドル\nとしてのあり方に悩み始める。だがメンバー\nと話す内に大切な事を思い出し、力強い足取\nりでステージに向かって行くのだった。", "zh": "在面向下一场公演的练习持续推进时，\n纱代子以一封粉丝信为契机，开始苦恼\n身为偶像的立足之本。但随着与成员们\n交谈，她回想起了重要的事物，以坚定的\n步伐迈向了舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_080_1000_027say", "source_sha256": "5e7a68de26437b2b54efb0cb0b9ac63d2f95265aca18d4dcf8c39d38146c5c9c", "ja": "みなさん！　私の新曲、聴いてくれて\n本当にありがとうございました！", "zh": "大家！非常感谢大家来听\n我的新歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_080_1001_null", "source_sha256": "29de350a06f5a39fa537846bf0bac121b7e24086720ddd096dc788e132fd43ba", "ja": "ワアァァァッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_080_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "7006a5d907ec1bfd65366c5befe10991c9f7b15085be0bb12d426b8ad5dc93d1", "ja": "私はアイドルに憧れて、ここまで来ました。仲間や\nファンの人達に、たくさん背中を押してもらって……。", "zh": "我是憧憬着偶像，才一路走到今天的。一路上，得到了伙伴们和粉丝们许多的支持……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_080_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "59ad7ae7380729bed59974bdc072638e513e1242c56e5f60df6ceb101f3fa1f1", "ja": "私、わかったんです。うまく言えないんですけど……\nアイドルは、私のすべてなんだって！", "zh": "我明白了。虽然说不太清楚……但偶像，就是我的一切！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_080_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "04e6658db164e28d8b3d8663abe9048ad0e108e0f6b2a1edf758b3014696feb0", "ja": "だから……これからも、精いっぱいがんばります！", "zh": "所以……今后我也会竭尽全力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_080_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1d95e564abdffeebd85ead97f2f5534b1752c67afc839332506defe5657c1012", "ja": "（歌に今の気持ちすべてを詰め込んで、\n紗代子は満ち足りた表情でステージを降りてきた）", "zh": "（纱代子把此刻所有的心情都倾注进歌声中，带着满足的表情走下了舞台）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_080_1006_p", "source_sha256": "db27573b217a1be9b00a9428146244ea996a3a08fa670194535473acc9b3b950", "ja": "紗代子、みんなも、お疲れさま！\nいいステージだったな！", "zh": "纱代子，还有大家，辛苦了！\n刚才的舞台很棒啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_080_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "4bc0951f08360f502f25a8c4a2a4dba4113d59e6f0f933495b1ebe29463db387", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがとうございます！\nはい！　これも、みなさんのおかげです！", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢您！\n是的！这也多亏了大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_080_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "8ae2613afc0396283a35db8d0d7067796b2b85c36b19423a8d1e36aa4146c503", "ja": "いつも一生懸命な紗代子ちゃんを\n見てきたから、私たちもがんばれたのよ。", "zh": "看到纱代子一直都那么拼命努力，\n我们也才能坚持下来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_080_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "aadc5c7bc2a8874b5ebcd239f0cbb0b3ce275b3675ff984ccfe9d748b184e3e7", "ja": "うん！　「アイドルは私のすべて」って言う\n紗代子ちゃん、かっこよかったよ！", "zh": "嗯！说出“偶像就是我的一切”的纱代子，真的很帅气哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_080_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "0f9883c0535dbe7794fc004675353f593f5a473955a35d5fc3f29ed346fbcab2", "ja": "紗代子ちゃんの気持ち、きっと、\nファンのみんなにも伝わったんじゃないかな。", "zh": "纱代子的心情，一定也传达给所有粉丝了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_080_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "39a4deffac883aa032215be7208a79f46815fbdc6c7e00d84153ac1abc564973", "ja": "私も、紗代子と同じステージに立てて、\nすごく勇気づけられたよ。ありがとう！", "zh": "我也能和纱代子站在同一个舞台上，真的受到了很大的鼓舞。谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_080_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "d52f564bbe348558f1b9001344b8e81ce1a9bbabb2bbcdadfbbd7f4a6cfd37a8", "ja": "みなさん……\n私のほうこそ、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "大家……\n我才应该向大家道谢，真的太感谢了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_080_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "7d85d865f4afb43620b61cccad67278f38898943218733e714aed13271028489", "ja": "さて、ライブが終わった後は……\nやっぱり、パーッと打ち上げよね♪", "zh": "那么，演出结束之后……\n果然还是要痛痛快快地办场庆功宴呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_080_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "63f32c935b5017c9b7e20f556068d8b96549b950ceb4f3bddb4191b570d401cc", "ja": "はい！　それじゃあ{$P$}さん、\nベタベタの体をさっぱりさせてきますね！", "zh": "好的！那么，{$P$}先生，我先去把黏糊糊的身体洗清爽啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_080_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b6b11c660411b95012b144014fa1359ba3d1eb7653a5b25f23bab5a7207343eb", "ja": "ああ、いってらっしゃい！\n……ん？", "zh": "啊，路上小心！\n……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_080_1017_p", "source_sha256": "267b7c96c3fede2fc481378dae6f2fdc251292d35cc2bb5ddbb98bac1cd3d84e", "ja": "（そういえば、以前の公演の後も、\n紗代子は客席を見ていた。あれはきっと……）", "zh": "（说起来，以前公演结束后，纱代子也一直看着观众席。那一定是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_080_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "ac8daabd24b983eaa249a1aab1c4d5f3b652d15e130a218925e9fd52c7c6c9d2", "ja": "{$P$}？\nあの、何か……？", "zh": "{$P$}？\n那个，有什么事吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_080_1019_p", "source_sha256": "27fad0439646e7c8e1707a24a5269d28595e003f7516ce342d0104167c43b06d", "ja": "いや。……今日の公演が、\n紗代子の友達にも、届いているといいな！", "zh": "没。……要是今天的演出，\n也能传达给纱代子的朋友就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_080_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "65474a1113267558bf5a859399cdf34a22dae7fdf599ba942536b3ea27d5c08c", "ja": "……！　はい！\nあの、私も着替えてきますね！", "zh": "……！　好的！\n那个，我也去换衣服了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_080_1021_p", "source_sha256": "34b3406e066996c03335e5409be91ffbc97d49491c230157bd08368b4ba012bf", "ja": "（そう言って駆け出す紗代子は、\n様々な想いを抱いているように見えた……）", "zh": "（说完这些，跑出去的纱代子看起来像是怀揣着各种各样的心情……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_080_1022_p", "source_sha256": "a07c4fa18986f8994136849c898a3bd80b682d5e14dcdbccb1b98b69babd4782", "ja": "（全てを抱えて、不器用に走り続ける……\nそんな紗代子だから、誰もが応援したくなるんだ！）", "zh": "（把一切都背负在身上，笨拙地不断奔跑……\n正因为紗代子是这样的人，大家才都会想为她加油啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
